---
// Hero: the opening hook. Atmospheric background slot, no fabricated imagery.
// [IMAGE] slot: owner will supply a real hero image; until then a subtle
// CSS atmosphere stands in, clearly not the final asset.
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-[70vh] items-end overflow-hidden border-b border-border-subtle" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08), transparent 60%), var(--color-bg-primary);">
	<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.04]" aria-hidden="true">
		<div
			class="h-full w-full"
			style="background-image: linear-gradient(var(--color-border-subtle) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-border-subtle) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 48px 48px;"></div>
	</div>

	<div class="container-archival relative z-10 w-full py-12 md:py-20">
		<p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-text-secondary uppercase">
			Archive 001 / The World
		</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl font-display text-5xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-text-primary md:text-6xl">
			Where stories breathe, <span class="text-accent-azure">and the summoned find their harbor.</span>
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary md:text-lg">
			Fablea is a living testament to humanity's storytelling power. A world where fictional
			characters from Earth's entertainment media are materialized into reality, coexisting with
			native residents and summoned Earthians.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary md:text-lg">
			Here, yachting is a way of life. Magic intertwines with advanced eco-technology, and the
			past never truly fades. It simply finds a new shore.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-2 border-t border-border-subtle pt-5">
			<dl class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-2">
				<div>
					<dt class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.1em] text-text-muted uppercase">Currency</dt>
					<dd class="font-mono text-xs text-accent-gold">AZL (1:1 USD)</dd>
				</div>
				<div>
					<dt class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.1em] text-text-muted uppercase">Core</dt>
					<dd class="font-mono text-xs text-text-primary">Twin Isles</dd>
				</div>
				<div>
					<dt class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.1em] text-text-muted uppercase">Governed by</dt>
					<dd class="font-mono text-xs text-text-primary">Isadora</dd>
				</div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
